PixelKit Labs Laya SDK

This package is adapted from Laya, developed by Convai Innovations and its
contributors and published at https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The TypeScript decision engine was adapted
from the Laya TypeScript implementation. PixelKit Labs added the standalone
package and React Native on-device adapter. See LICENSE for the license text.

Laya model checkpoints are separate artifacts published by Convai Innovations
at https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya. They are not included in this
npm package. Check the license and model card of each checkpoint you distribute.
